  "notes": "The sheet discusses compact quotient tori and then gives Corollaire 1 about V_K/V_K0 and the unit subgroup. The first attempt is cancelled, including an unfinished equality. The live proof passes to the real base and displays the quotient by G_m as a product of circles. It concludes with the implication (iv)⇒(i). Written slips are retained: the proof switches from K_0 to L_0; K_R ≃ C^{*r} contains a star; the degree is [K_0:K]=r; the last norm is N_{L/K}, while the preceding page wrote N_{K/L} for the map from K to L. Local dimension check 142.N1: the displayed K_0 tensor R ≃ R^r gives dim_Q K_0=r, since a Q-basis tensors to an R-basis. This identifies Q as the degree base used by that calculation, while the ink plainly has K. The index order and star were retained, not silently repaired. Archive number 141 appears at the foot.",
